===== en | 120x24 | menu =====

what would you like to do?

> cast           browse the authored characters, at any level
  new character  author one, with the budget and the carry check live
  origins        the works the cast is borrowed from, and add one
  skills         the declared skills, who may carry each, add or edit one
  statuses       look a buff or debuff up: what each does, how long, how many
  traits         look a trait up: what each does, and who learns it
  elements       look the chart up: what it beats, what beats it, at what rate
  species        look a kind up: what each one means
  builds         look a build up: which skills and which trait it takes
  squads         build a side to fight: who is in it, its kit, where it stands
  fight          put two sides against each other, or play the battle yourself
  check          see that the art is there and the budget is kept

Everything written here goes through the same checks as hexforge, and the
game boots from the embedded copy — rebuild before an edit reaches a battle.
A form writes on ctrl+s, and on a Mac cmd+S does it too where the terminal
passes the chord through instead of opening its own Save dialog.

